OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow to talk to your kids about
OL,4,Aback to school nerves
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools, parents and pupils in Surrey
OL,7,Fare preparing for the new school year,
OL,8,Fbut for many this can be a
OL,9,Fnerve-wracking time.
OL,11,FAccording to Department for Education
OL,12,Fdata, Surrey pupils missed 5.8% of
OL,13,Fschool sessions during the 2025 autumn
OL,14,Fterm.
OL,16,FThis is below the national average but
OL,17,Fthe figure remains above the county's
OL,18,Fpre-pandemic level of 4.3% from 2019,
OL,19,Fafter the Surrey absence rate peaked at
OL,20,F7.0% in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
