OL,3,GNEWSAHow to talk to your kids about
OL,4,Aback to school nerves
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the autumn term 2025, 15.1% of
OL,7,Fpupils were classed as persistently
OL,8,Fabsent, meaning they missed more than
OL,9,Fone in ten school sessions.
